<title>USA: Zaxis arranges conditional financing.</title>
<headline>Zaxis arranges conditional financing.</headline>
<dateline>HUDSON, Ohio 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zaxis International Inc said on Friday it entered an agreement with MML Management Ltd of Australia for conditional financing, and named three new board members as part of the deal.</p>
<p>Two MML principals, Alan Scott and Craig Jones, joined the Zaxis board, along with Conaly Bedell, a business consultant.</p>
<p>	  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
